        "text": "How it works",
        "level": "h3"
      }
    },
    "how-text": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Every command, port, env var, and endpoint path was verified against `src/index.ts` and the `add-a2a` script before writing — no guessing. The README explains the actual mechanics: gateway reads `skills.json`, advertises each skill on its agent card, spawns `claude -p -` per task, returns output as an artifact. Docs-only, zero behavior change."
